# Implementation Plan - Step 5: Text-to-Speech (TTS) Voice Engine

Integrate Text-to-Speech (TTS) voice synthesis into VoxVision AI, completing the full end-to-end voice conversation pipeline:
`Voice` $\rightarrow$ `Whisper STT` $\rightarrow$ `Text` $\rightarrow$ `Groq LLM` $\rightarrow$ `AI Response Text` $\rightarrow$ `TTS Engine` $\rightarrow$ `Spoken Voice`.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **TTS Engine Architecture**: Implements a dedicated backend Speech Synthesis Service (`backend/app/services/tts_service.py`) using `gTTS` / `httpx` MP3 audio generation serving `POST /api/tts`, with a Web Speech Synthesis client fallback to ensure 100% reliable audio playback.
> **Full Voice Loop**: When a user submits a prompt via Microphone, VoxVision AI automatically synthesizes and speaks the AI response upon receipt.
> **UI Design Consistency**: Preserves the existing dark developer aesthetic (`#090a0e`, `#11141c`, `#161a26`, `#6366f1`). Adds a subtle "Listen" speaker button next to the "Copy" button on assistant message bubbles.

